/P 434 0 R
/E <>
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
1174 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 434 0 R
/E (For many years following, Manhattan Community Board 3 has consistently included both the remaining pedestrian mall renovations and the Delancey Street comfort station in its annual capital budget requests to the City, though to our knowledge, these requests have not yet resulted in implementation.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
