1181 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 435 0 R
/E (Prior capital assessments by NYC Parks indicate that a renovation budget of approx $2M is appropriate for bringing the structure to full use. Our proposed cultural program offers a more flexible, phased capital plan that can begin activation at a significantly lower initial cost while pursuing supplemental capital in partnership with public and private funders. )
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
1182 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 435 0 R
/E (Prior funding attempts, restoration specs and capital recognition at the $1M+ level has set important precedent for framing a $2M renovation estimate \(for this stretch of mall at Allen and Delancey\) as a reasonable and historically grounded starting point.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
